    tags: ["arcteryx", "아크테릭스", "clothing", "ax-womens", "womens"],
    descriptionKo: "빠르고 기술적인 등반을 위한 알파인 준비 내구성과 경량 성능.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009866/graphite-black/8.jpg"],
