    tags: ["arcteryx", "아크테릭스", "clothing", "ax-womens", "womens"],
    descriptionKo: "매우 가볍고 통기성이 뛰어나며 런닝 조끼와 호환되는 러닝용 탱크입니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/shincha/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/mallow/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/mallow/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/mallow/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/mallow/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/mallow/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/mallow/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010238/black/6.jpg"],
