    descriptionKo: "오지와 리조트를 위한 단열 GORE-TEX 팬츠.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/7.jpg"],
    hoverImage: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009107/black/2.jpg",
