    tags: ["arcteryx", "아크테릭스", "clothing", "ax-womens", "womens"],
    descriptionKo: "비교할 수 없는 내구성과 뚜렷한 핏을 갖춘 프리라이드 전용 바지입니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009860/arctic-silk/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009860/arctic-silk/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009860/arctic-silk/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009860/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009860/black/2.jpg"],
    hoverImage: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009860/arctic-silk/2.jpg",
