    descriptionKo: "건조하고 따뜻함 - 가장 다재다능한 단열 GORE-TEX 마운틴 쉘입니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010510/black/8.jpg"],
